      "content": "exactly. it's just... it feels like there's no light at the end of the tunnel. like no matter how much i give, it's never enough to make a dent. i’m just so incredibly weary of the fight. sometimes i wonder if there's any peace to be found in just... stopping. in just letting the weight fall. does that even make sense?",
